# Captured traces are large and are never committed.
#
# `trace/runs/*.trace` is tens to hundreds of megabytes per campaign, and an APK
# is never copied in. What IS worth keeping is the small, derived record:
# `trace/REPORT.md` is regenerated from the traces by `trace/measure.mjs`, and
# every number in `trace/FINDINGS.md` is quotable from it.
runs/
runs2/

# Python bytecode from `trace/parse.py`.
__pycache__/
trace/runs/*.trace
__pycache__/
*.pyc
